OL,3,GNEWSALong waits 'a tragedy' as
OL,4,Athousands seek ADHD and autism
OL,5,Aassessments
OL,6,
OL,7,FA GP has warned that long waits for
OL,8,FADHD and autism assessments are
OL,9,Fcreating a situation where the people
OL,10,Fmost in need are not being seen.
OL,12,FAccording to experts, demand has risen
OL,13,Fso sharply in recent years that it now
OL,14,Ffar exceeds what the mental health
OL,15,Fsystem can cope with.
OL,17,FNew figures seen by BBC Scotland News
OL,18,Fsuggest more than 38,000 adults are
OL,19,Fwaiting for neurodevelopmental
OL,20,Fassessments, with at least 14,000 of
OL,21,Fthem waiting longer than two years.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
