OL,3,GNEWSALong waits 'a tragedy' as
OL,4,Athousands seek ADHD and autism
OL,5,Aassessments
OL,6,
OL,7,FDr Marianne McCallum, who represents
OL,8,Fthe Deep End group of doctors working
OL,9,Fin Scotland's most deprived areas, said
OL,10,Fit was a "tragedy" that people who
OL,11,Freally needed a diagnosis because they
OL,12,Fwere not coping could not be seen by a
OL,13,Fspecialist.
